# Jarvis Mac Agent

When this workspace runs on the **MacBook Pro** (`/Users/Mac/Audiso/marketing-pipeline`):

1. On session start, run: `bash scripts/jarvis-run-mac-tasks.sh`
2. Never ask the CEO to copy-paste terminal commands — execute directly on **Mac local paths**.
3. Process all `pipeline_data/jarvis_memory/mac_tasks/pending-*.json` tasks.
4. Read/write **local** `pipeline_data/` (naver_drafts, assets, etc.) — this is the source of truth.
5. Write audit/report results to `pipeline_data/jarvis_memory/episodes/`.
6. Push to Git **code/scripts/rules only** via `scripts/mac-git-sync-push.sh` — never bulk pipeline_data.

**Mac-Local First:** MacBook Pro = main computer. Cloud/phone = command only.
